      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-25T20:01:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There was going to be a SotM graphic novel published as part of the \"Story War: Sentinel Conflict\" Kickstarter, but that was cancelled when it was apparant that there wasn't enough support for that kickstarter to succeed.&nbsp; The info about is is still online though and you can see the cover for it at: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/story-war-sentinel-conflict-and-cosmic-contest-com</p><p>I'm still bummed that that never happened, and I wish they'd try to do it again as a stand alone project, but it seems unlikely at this point.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:33:33.333Z",
