      "raw": "<p>There was going to be a SotM graphic novel published as part of the &quot;Story War: Sentinel Conflict&quot; Kickstarter, but that was cancelled when it was apparant that there wasn&#39;t enough support for that kickstarter to succeed.&nbsp; The info about is is still online though and you can see the cover for it at: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/story-war-sentinel-conflict-and-cosmic-contest-com</p><p>I&#39;m still bummed that that never happened, and I wish they&#39;d try to do it again as a stand alone project, but it seems unlikely at this point.</p>",
